#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:2
msgid "Server Migration"
msgstr "Server Migration"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports migrating virtual machines between hosts, clusters, or "
"resource pools within a cloud. The migration (also referred to as VM Move) "
"allows you to relocate a workload to a different compute target without "
"reprovisioning."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| soporta migrating virtual machines entre hosts, clusters, o "
"recurso pools dentro de un cloud. El migración (también referred a como VM "
"Mover) permite you a relocate un carga de trabajo a un diferente compute "
"destino sin reprovisioning."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:9
msgid ""
"Migration is supported for cloud types that provide native VM mobility, such"
" as VMware vSphere (vMotion), Nutanix AHV, and other hypervisor platforms."
msgstr ""
"Migración es soportado para cloud tipos ese proporcionar native VM mobility,"
" como VMware vSphere (vMotion), Nutanix AHV, y otro hypervisor platforms."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:12
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:14
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Compute`` role permission at **Full** level is required to"
" perform migrations."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Compute`` permiso de rol en **Full** nivel es requerido a "
"perform migrations."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:17
msgid "Migrating a Server"
msgstr "Migrating un Servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:19
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Compute > Virtual Machines`` or to the server"
" detail page"
msgstr ""
"Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Compute > Virtual Machines`` o a el server "
"detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:20
msgid "Select the target server"
msgstr "Seleccionar el destino servidor"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:21
msgid "Click :guilabel:`ACTIONS`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`ACCIONES`"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:22
msgid "Select **Migrate**"
msgstr "Seleccionar **Migrate**"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:23
msgid "In the migration dialog, configure:"
msgstr "En el migración dialog, configure:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:25
msgid "TARGET HOST"
msgstr "TARGET HOST"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:26
msgid ""
"Select the destination hypervisor host. Available hosts are filtered based "
"on the server's current cloud and compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el destino hypervisor host. Disponible hosts son filtered basado"
" en el servidor's actual cloud y compatibility."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:27
msgid "TARGET RESOURCE POOL"
msgstr "TARGET RESOURCE POOL"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:28
msgid ""
"Select the destination resource pool or cluster (if applicable). This may be"
" required for cross-cluster migrations."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el destino recurso pool o cluster (si corresponde). Este puede "
"ser requerido para cross-cluster migrations."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:29
msgid "TARGET DATASTORE"
msgstr "TARGET DATASTORE"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:30
msgid ""
"Select the destination datastore for the VM's storage (for storage "
"migrations or combined compute+storage moves)."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el destino datastore para el VM's storage (para storage "
"migrations o combined compute+storage moves)."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:36
msgid "PRIORITY"
msgstr "PRIORITY"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:32
msgid "Migration priority level (where supported by the hypervisor):"
msgstr "Migración priority nivel (donde soportado por el hypervisor):"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:34
msgid "**Low** — Background migration with minimal impact"
msgstr "**Low** — Background migración con minimal impact"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:35
msgid "**Normal** — Standard priority"
msgstr "**Normal** — Estándar priority"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:36
msgid "**High** — Prioritized migration"
msgstr "**High** — Prioritized migración"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:38
msgid "Click :guilabel:`EXECUTE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`EXECUTE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:40
msgid ""
"The migration operation runs asynchronously. Progress can be monitored on "
"the server's History tab."
msgstr ""
"El migración operación ejecuta asynchronously. Progress puede be monitored "
"en el servidor's Historial pestaña."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:43
msgid "Migration Types"
msgstr "Migration Tipos"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:46
msgid "Live Migration (vMotion)"
msgstr "Live Migración (vMotion)"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:46
msgid ""
"The VM is moved while running, with no downtime. Requires shared storage or "
"storage vMotion capability between source and destination hosts."
msgstr ""
"El VM es moved mientras ejecutando, con no downtime. Requiere shared storage"
" o storage vMotion capability entre origen y destino hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:49
msgid "Cold Migration"
msgstr "Cold Migration"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:49
msgid ""
"The VM is powered off, moved to the new location, and optionally powered "
"back on. Used when live migration prerequisites are not met."
msgstr ""
"El VM es powered off, moved al nuevo location, y opcionalmente powered back "
"en. Used cuando live migración requisitos previos son no met."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:52
msgid "Storage Migration"
msgstr "Storage Migration"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:52
msgid ""
"Only the VM's storage is relocated to a different datastore. The VM remains "
"on the same host."
msgstr ""
"Solo el VM's storage es relocated a un diferente datastore. El VM remains en"
" el mismo host."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:54
msgid ""
"Migration availability and options depend on the underlying cloud type and "
"hypervisor capabilities. Not all cloud types support all migration modes."
msgstr ""
"Migración disponibilidad y opciones depend en el underlying cloud tipo y "
"hypervisor capabilities. No todos cloud tipos support todos migración modos."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:57
msgid "Monitoring Migration Status"
msgstr "Monitoring Migration Estado"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:59
msgid ""
"Migration operations appear in the server's **History** tab with status "
"indicators:"
msgstr ""
"Migración operaciones aparecer en el servidor's **History** pestaña con "
"estado indicators:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:61
msgid "**Running** — Migration is in progress"
msgstr "**Running** — Migración es en progress"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:62
msgid "**Complete** — Migration finished successfully"
msgstr "**Complete** — Migración finished exitosamente"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/server_migration.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Failed** — Migration encountered an error (check event details for the "
"failure reason)"
msgstr ""
"**Falló** — Migración encountered un error (verificar evento details para el"
" fallo reason)"
